  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Comeback Nudge 1: quiet-client check-ins and pack renewal\nRuns every morning. Reads your Clients sheet and sends a friendly check-in when someone has gone quiet (3 escalating, polite steps) and a renewal message when their pack is nearly used up. Resets a client automatically once they train again.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named Clients using the header row in sheet-templates/Clients.csv; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n2. In Config set your business and coach name, owner email, your booking link and your own pack/payment link, and the day thresholds. channel = email (default) or sms.\n3. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth) only if you use SMS.\n4. Dates in the sheet are YYYY-MM-DD (format the columns as plain text). Run once with test rows, then activate.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
